{"doc_id": "262e3a41d23a25cc00562b9ae8f3ca95cfa372633492d430a5836c65ffb8cae2", "extractor_version": "0.3.0", "schema_version": "1.1.0", "field": "submission_modes", "status": "present", "value_ja": "本件は、入札、資料提出、開札等を電子調達\nシステムを利用した方式により実施するものと\nする。\nただし、同方式により難い者は、支出負\n担行為担当官の承諾を得た場合に限り、紙入札\n方式により参加し、又は紙入札方式へ変更する\nことができる。", "normalized": {"modes": ["electronic", "in_person"], "mail_not_allowed": false}, "value_en": "Conducted via the Electronic Procurement System; bidders unable to use the system may participate by or switch to paper bidding only with the Obligating Officer's approval.", "citations": ["h_s82", "h_s83", "h_s84", "h_s85", "h_s86", "h_s87", "h_s88"], "provenance": {"pre_labelers": [{"provider": "web", "model": "gemini-web", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-web"}, {"provider": "local", "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-l1"}], "agreement": false, "auto_checks": [{"name": "schema_valid", "passed": true}, {"name": "citations_exist", "passed": true}, {"name": "field_applicable", "passed": true}, {"name": "value_in_citation", "passed": true}, {"name": "values_roundtrip", "passed": true}, {"name": "heading_cue", "passed": true}], "reviewed_by": "claude_code", "review_note": "accepted A; h_s82-h_s84 say the whole procedure runs on the electronic system; h_s85-h_s88 allow paper bidding only with the officer's approval. A bid submission place exists (h_s69), so in_person counts. Nothing in the document mentions mail bids, so mail is not in modes. B's mail_not_allowed=true has no sentence behind it (no 認めない or similar).", "final_state": "silver_model_reviewed", "prompt_version": "sv4", "labeler_overlap": true, "reviewed_choice": "web"}}
