{"doc_id": "262e3a41d23a25cc00562b9ae8f3ca95cfa372633492d430a5836c65ffb8cae2", "extractor_version": "0.3.0", "schema_version": "1.1.0", "field": "tax_basis", "status": "present", "value_ja": "(6) 入札方法 落札決定に当たっては、入札書\nに記載された金額に当該金額の10パーセント\nに相当する額を加算した金額（当該金額に１\n円未満の端数があるときは、その端数金額を\n切り捨てるものとする。）\nをもって落札価格\nとするので、入札者は、消費税に係る課税事\n業者であるか免税事業者であるかを問わず、\n見積もった契約金額の110分の100に相当する\n金額を入札書に記載すること。", "normalized": {"basis": "bid_excludes_tax"}, "value_en": "At award, 10% is added to the amount written on the bid form; bidders must enter 100/110 of the estimated contract amount on the bid form (excluding consumption tax).", "citations": ["h_s37", "h_s38", "h_s39", "h_s40", "h_s41", "h_s42", "h_s43", "h_s44", "h_s45", "h_s46"], "provenance": {"pre_labelers": [{"provider": "web", "model": "gemini-web", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-web"}, {"provider": "local", "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-l1"}], "agreement": true, "auto_checks": [{"name": "schema_valid", "passed": true}, {"name": "citations_exist", "passed": true}, {"name": "field_applicable", "passed": true}, {"name": "value_in_citation", "passed": true}, {"name": "values_roundtrip", "passed": true}, {"name": "heading_cue", "passed": true}], "reviewed_by": "claude_code", "review_note": "accepted A; h_s37-h_s46: the winning price is the bid amount plus 10 percent, and the bidder writes 100/110 of the estimated contract amount on the bid form, whether taxable or exempt. That is a bid written without tax: bid_excludes_tax (same reading as the guide's tax wording rules and the other items in this batch). A cites the whole 消費税 sentence, B only the last two lines, which lack the 消費税 wording. The roundtrip failure comes from the sentence being split over many lines.", "final_state": "silver_model_reviewed", "prompt_version": "sv4", "labeler_overlap": true, "reviewed_choice": "web"}}
